{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_012_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "dcec335115f067262ab9655702bc1cbefb6788a6634ba0d62f3ae39d23b329b1", "ja": "うう……\nど、どっちだったっけ……。\n思い出せない……。", "zh": "呜呜……\n到、到底该怎么跳才对……？\n我想不起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_012_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "ff864d44bec913b6f8b5b88f73143b73e0ed4b0faa9c09e61e91e499c465f32c", "ja": "ありゃ、可憐？\n難しい顔しちゃって、どったの？", "zh": "哎呀，可怜？\n看你一副伤透脑筋的样子，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_012_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "b99ae186dd67650e1fc785c11a6a6e5af1c5682c7696c96ca995ab25bb98b5bd", "ja": "あ、め、恵美ちゃん……。\nあの……ふ、振り付けを、\n忘れちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，惠、惠美……\n那个……我、我忘记舞步了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_012_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "8dc4c12ef162a2afbb8b9032dd91600c8090554f8b1fd4f16e9627a872ba3bdc", "ja": "ふたりとも、どうしたノ？", "zh": "你们两个怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_012_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "f62054570c5a30d933de3993c1fd395b6a4102cbe3f94855f6dad2c60655c6e6", "ja": "エレナ、いいところに！　\nあの曲の振り付けって、\nこんなカンジだったよね？", "zh": "艾琳娜，你来得正好！\n那首歌的舞步，\n是像这样对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_012_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "b3f9fbc9ce0d6d1567f0893122e6018aa0208bf150248e08fef7e404a98233bb", "ja": "違うヨ、メグミ。\nこんなカンジだヨ～！\nねっ、カレン？", "zh": "不是啦，惠美。\n是像这样唷～！\n对吧，可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
